# UI and pages

`"use client"` only when the file needs state, events, or context. Pages stay server components and pass fetched data into client children.

`Container` is `max-w-modimal` (`--container-modimal: 1240px`). Tokens in `src/app/globals.css`: paper `#FDFBF7`, sable ink `#1C1A17` (`--ink`, `--brand-navy`), muted ink `#7B736B` (`--ink-muted`, `--muted-foreground`, `--brand-slate`; 4.5:1 on paper), rosewood CTA `#A87C7C` (`--brand`, `--primary`; hover `#8F6565`), taupe border `#E1DCD6`, olive `#5F6E50` (sustainability chips only). Fonts: Source Sans 3 (`--font-sans-var`) for UI; Cormorant Garamond (`--font-serif-var`) for wordmark (`tracking-wordmark`) and `.heading-page` / `.heading-section`. Body copy leading is `leading-copy`. Eyebrow tracking is `tracking-eyebrow`. Radius is 0, except color swatches and carousel dots, which stay circles. Focus rings are `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring`. Rosewood is fills only — links stay sable (`hover:text-brand-navy`). Button variants come from `src/components/ui/button.tsx` (`default`, `outline`, `secondary`, `ghost`, `destructive`, `link`), with `size="xl"` (`h-12`) for storefront CTAs. `cn` is the `cn` package, re-exported by `src/lib/utils.ts`.

ProductCard links to `/product/${product.id}`. The heart on the card is decorative. Wishlist toggles live on the purchase panel.

Header and mobile nav read `NAV_ITEMS` from `src/data/navigation.ts`. Only Collection has a mega menu. `fetchShopifyNavItems` is not wired up. `NEW_IN_MEGA_MENU`, `PLUS_SIZE_MEGA_MENU`, and `SUSTAINABILITY_MEGA_MENU` feed landing pages, not the header.

Static and still the source of truth: `navigation.ts`, `home.ts`, `faq.ts`, `modiweek.ts`, `sustainability.ts`, and the filter/hero objects in `search.ts`, `shop-all.ts`, `plus-size.ts`. Contact, newsletter, and “Start Chat” do not call an API. `/modiweek` redirects to the default day slug. `/sustainability/mission` links to `/sustainability/suppliers`, which has no page.

Do not add `data-testid` unless a test needs it. E2E uses roles and accessible names from `e2e/helpers/fixtures.ts`, not `@playwright/test` directly. Prefer the components the page already imports.
